<title>USA: AMP sees Q2 sales, oper earnings up from Q1.</title>
<headline>AMP sees Q2 sales, oper earnings up from Q1.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISBURG, Pa. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP Inc said Wednesday it expects its second quarter and second half sales and operating earnings to grow from first-quarter levels.</p>
<p>The company said it expects its restructuring actions to result in savings at about a $50 million annualized rate when fully implemented later this year.</p>
<p>The company said it expects all restructuring actions to be completed by the end of the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company reported operating income of $101 million versus $116 million.</p>
</text>
